{"seq":2,"slug":"coroutines-in-android","title":"Android 协程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/networking-and-data/coroutines-in-android","wordCount":578,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"android-协程\">Android 协程</h1><p>Kotlin 协程是 Android 异步编程的基础。Android 提供了与生命周期集成的协程作用域，确保协程在组件销毁时自动取消，避免内存泄漏和资源浪费。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Android 协程围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生命周期作用域</strong>：<code>viewModelScope</code>（随 ViewModel 清除取消）、<code>lifecycleScope</code>（随 onDestroy 取消）、<code>rememberCoroutineScope()</code>（离开组合取消）；<code>GlobalScope</code> 不会自动取消，应避免。</li>\n<li><strong>生命周期安全收集</strong>：<code>repeatOnLifecycle(STARTED)</code> 让 Flow 收集随组件可见性启停，Compose 中对应 <code>collectAsStateWithLifecycle()</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>调度器（Dispatcher）</strong>：<code>Main</code> 用于 UI，<code>IO</code> 用于网络/文件/DB，<code>Default</code> 用于 CPU 密集计算；通过依赖注入提供，便于测试替换为 <code>TestDispatcher</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>结构化并发与异常</strong>：<code>coroutineScope</code> + <code>async</code> 实现并行；取消会级联到子协程，<code>CancellationException</code> 必须重新抛出而不能静默吞掉。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"viewmodelscope\">viewModelScope</h2><p><code>viewModelScope</code> 是 ViewModel 内置的协程作用域，在 ViewModel 清除时自动取消所有协程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@HiltViewModel&#10;class ArticleListViewModel @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val repository: ArticleRepository&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow(ArticleListUiState())&#10;    val uiState = _uiState.asStateFlow()&#10;&#10;    init {&#10;        loadArticles()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun loadArticles() {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch {&#10;            _uiState.update { it.copy(isLoading = true, error = null) }&#10;            try {&#10;                val articles = repository.getArticles()&#10;                _uiState.update { it.copy(articles = articles, isLoading = false) }&#10;            } catch (e: CancellationException) {&#10;                throw e&#10;            } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;                _uiState.update { it.copy(error = e.message, isLoading = false) }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun deleteArticle(id: String) {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch {&#10;            repository.deleteArticle(id)&#10;            _uiState.update { state -&gt;&#10;                state.copy(articles = state.articles.filter { it.id != id })&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@HiltViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ArticleListViewModel @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository: ArticleRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow(ArticleListUiState())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val uiState = _uiState.asStateFlow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    init {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loadArticles()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun loadArticles() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _uiState.update { it.copy(isLoading = true, error = null) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val articles = repository.getArticles()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                _uiState.update { it.copy(articles = articles, isLoading = false) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            } catch (e: CancellationException) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                throw e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                _uiState.update { it.copy(error = e.message, isLoading = false) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun deleteArticle(id: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            repository.deleteArticle(id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _uiState.update { state -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                state.copy(articles = state.articles.filter { it.id != id })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[ViewModel 创建] --&gt; B[viewModelScope 活跃]&#10;    B --&gt; C[launch 协程 1]&#10;    B --&gt; D[launch 协程 2]&#10;    B --&gt; E[launch 协程 N]&#10;    F[ViewModel.onCleared] --&gt; G[viewModelScope.cancel]&#10;    G --&gt; H[所有协程自动取消]&#10;&#10;    classDef scopeStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class B scopeStyle\">graph TD\n    A[ViewModel 创建] --&gt; B[viewModelScope 活跃]\n    B --&gt; C[launch 协程 1]\n    B --&gt; D[launch 协程 2]\n    B --&gt; E[launch 协程 N]\n    F[ViewModel.onCleared] --&gt; G[viewModelScope.cancel]\n    G --&gt; H[所有协程自动取消]\n\n    classDef scopeStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class B scopeStyle</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"lifecyclescope\">lifecycleScope</h2><p><code>lifecycleScope</code> 绑定到 Activity/Fragment 的生命周期，<code>repeatOnLifecycle</code> 在指定生命周期状态时重启收集。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@AndroidEntryPoint&#10;class MainActivity : ComponentActivity() {&#10;&#10;    private val viewModel: MainViewModel by viewModels()&#10;&#10;    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {&#10;        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)&#10;&#10;        lifecycleScope.launch {&#10;            repeatOnLifecycle(Lifecycle.State.STARTED) {&#10;                launch {&#10;                    viewModel.uiState.collect { state -&gt;&#10;                        updateUI(state)&#10;                    }&#10;                }&#10;                launch {&#10;                    viewModel.events.collect { event -&gt;&#10;                        handleEvent(event)&#10;                    }&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 在 Compose 中等价的写法&#10;@Composable&#10;fun MainScreen(viewModel: MainViewModel = hiltViewModel()) {&#10;    val uiState by viewModel.uiState.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()&#10;&#10;    LaunchedEffect(Unit) {&#10;        viewModel.events.collect { event -&gt;&#10;            // 处理一次性事件&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@AndroidEntryPoint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class MainActivity : ComponentActivity() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val viewModel: MainViewModel by viewModels()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        lifecycleScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            repeatOnLifecycle(Lifecycle.State.STARTED) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    viewModel.uiState.collect { state -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        updateUI(state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    viewModel.events.collect { event -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        handleEvent(event)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 Compose 中等价的写法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun MainScreen(viewModel: MainViewModel = hiltViewModel()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val uiState by viewModel.uiState.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LaunchedEffect(Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel.events.collect { event -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 处理一次性事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>作用域</th>\n<th>所属组件</th>\n<th>取消时机</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>viewModelScope</code></td>\n<td>ViewModel</td>\n<td>ViewModel.onCleared</td>\n<td>数据加载、业务逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lifecycleScope</code></td>\n<td>Activity/Fragment</td>\n<td>onDestroy</td>\n<td>UI 操作、Flow 收集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rememberCoroutineScope()</code></td>\n<td>Composable</td>\n<td>离开组合</td>\n<td>响应用户事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GlobalScope</code></td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>不会自动取消</td>\n<td><strong>避免使用</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"调度器选择\">调度器选择</h2><p>正确选择 Dispatcher 对性能和 ANR 避免至关重要。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class ArticleRepository @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val api: ArticleApi,&#10;    private val dao: ArticleDao,&#10;    @IoDispatcher private val ioDispatcher: CoroutineDispatcher&#10;) {&#10;    suspend fun getArticles(): List&lt;Article&gt; = withContext(ioDispatcher) {&#10;        try {&#10;            val remote = api.getArticles()&#10;            dao.insertAll(remote.data?.map { it.toEntity() } ?: emptyList())&#10;            remote.data?.map { it.toDomain() } ?: emptyList()&#10;        } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;            dao.getAll().first().map { it.toDomain() }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    suspend fun processImage(bitmap: Bitmap): Bitmap = withContext(Dispatchers.Default) {&#10;        // CPU 密集型图像处理&#10;        bitmap.scale(bitmap.width / 2, bitmap.height / 2)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Module&#10;@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;object DispatcherModule {&#10;&#10;    @IoDispatcher&#10;    @Provides&#10;    fun provideIoDispatcher(): CoroutineDispatcher = Dispatchers.IO&#10;&#10;    @DefaultDispatcher&#10;    @Provides&#10;    fun provideDefaultDispatcher(): CoroutineDispatcher = Dispatchers.Default&#10;&#10;    @MainDispatcher&#10;    @Provides&#10;    fun provideMainDispatcher(): CoroutineDispatcher = Dispatchers.Main&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Qualifier&#10;@Retention(AnnotationRetention.BINARY)&#10;annotation class IoDispatcher&#10;&#10;@Qualifier&#10;@Retention(AnnotationRetention.BINARY)&#10;annotation class DefaultDispatcher&#10;&#10;@Qualifier&#10;@Retention(AnnotationRetention.BINARY)&#10;annotation class MainDispatcher\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ArticleRepository @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val api: ArticleApi,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val dao: ArticleDao,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @IoDispatcher private val ioDispatcher: CoroutineDispatcher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun getArticles(): List&#x3C;Article> = withContext(ioDispatcher) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val remote = api.getArticles()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dao.insertAll(remote.data?.map { it.toEntity() } ?: emptyList())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            remote.data?.map { it.toDomain() } ?: emptyList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dao.getAll().first().map { it.toDomain() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun processImage(bitmap: Bitmap): Bitmap = withContext(Dispatchers.Default) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // CPU 密集型图像处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bitmap.scale(bitmap.width / 2, bitmap.height / 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object DispatcherModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @IoDispatcher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideIoDispatcher(): CoroutineDispatcher = Dispatchers.IO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @DefaultDispatcher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideDefaultDispatcher(): CoroutineDispatcher = Dispatchers.Default</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @MainDispatcher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideMainDispatcher(): CoroutineDispatcher = Dispatchers.Main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Qualifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Retention(AnnotationRetention.BINARY)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>annotation class IoDispatcher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Qualifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Retention(AnnotationRetention.BINARY)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>annotation class DefaultDispatcher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Qualifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Retention(AnnotationRetention.BINARY)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>annotation class MainDispatcher</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Dispatchers.Main] --&gt; B[UI 操作]&#10;    C[Dispatchers.IO] --&gt; D[网络请求 / 文件IO / 数据库]&#10;    E[Dispatchers.Default] --&gt; F[CPU 密集计算]&#10;    G[Dispatchers.Unconfined] --&gt; H[测试用途]&#10;&#10;    classDef mainStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    classDef ioStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    classDef defaultStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A mainStyle&#10;    class C ioStyle&#10;    class E defaultStyle\">graph TD\n    A[Dispatchers.Main] --&gt; B[UI 操作]\n    C[Dispatchers.IO] --&gt; D[网络请求 / 文件IO / 数据库]\n    E[Dispatchers.Default] --&gt; F[CPU 密集计算]\n    G[Dispatchers.Unconfined] --&gt; H[测试用途]\n\n    classDef mainStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef ioStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef defaultStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A mainStyle\n    class C ioStyle\n    class E defaultStyle</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调度器</th>\n<th>线程池</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>并发限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Dispatchers.Main</code></td>\n<td>主线程</td>\n<td>UI 更新</td>\n<td>1 个线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Dispatchers.IO</code></td>\n<td>共享池</td>\n<td>网络/文件/DB</td>\n<td>默认 64 线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Dispatchers.Default</code></td>\n<td>共享池</td>\n<td>CPU 密集计算</td>\n<td>CPU 核心数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Dispatchers.Main.immediate</code></td>\n<td>主线程</td>\n<td>已在主线程则立即执行</td>\n<td>1 个线程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 通过依赖注入提供 Dispatcher，而非直接使用 <code>Dispatchers.IO</code>，便于在测试中替换为 <code>TestDispatcher</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"取消与结构化并发\">取消与结构化并发</h2><p>协程的结构化并发确保子协程在父协程取消时一并取消。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@HiltViewModel&#10;class SearchViewModel @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val repository: SearchRepository&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    private var searchJob: Job? = null&#10;&#10;    fun search(query: String) {&#10;        searchJob?.cancel()&#10;        searchJob = viewModelScope.launch {&#10;            delay(300) // debounce&#10;            val results = repository.search(query)&#10;            _searchResults.value = results&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun parallelLoad() {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch {&#10;            val (articles, users, tags) = coroutineScope {&#10;                val articlesDeferred = async { repository.getArticles() }&#10;                val usersDeferred = async { repository.getUsers() }&#10;                val tagsDeferred = async { repository.getTags() }&#10;                Triple(&#10;                    articlesDeferred.await(),&#10;                    usersDeferred.await(),&#10;                    tagsDeferred.await()&#10;                )&#10;            }&#10;            _uiState.update {&#10;                it.copy(articles = articles, users = users, tags = tags)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@HiltViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class SearchViewModel @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository: SearchRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private var searchJob: Job? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun search(query: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        searchJob?.cancel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        searchJob = viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            delay(300) // debounce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val results = repository.search(query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _searchResults.value = results</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun parallelLoad() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val (articles, users, tags) = coroutineScope {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val articlesDeferred = async { repository.getArticles() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val usersDeferred = async { repository.getUsers() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val tagsDeferred = async { repository.getTags() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Triple(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    articlesDeferred.await(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    usersDeferred.await(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    tagsDeferred.await()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _uiState.update {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                it.copy(articles = articles, users = users, tags = tags)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"异常处理\">异常处理</h2><p>协程中的异常处理需要特别注意 <code>CancellationException</code> 不能被静默吞掉。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@HiltViewModel&#10;class SafeViewModel @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val repository: DataRepository&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow&lt;UiState&gt;(UiState.Loading)&#10;    val uiState = _uiState.asStateFlow()&#10;&#10;    private val exceptionHandler = CoroutineExceptionHandler { _, throwable -&gt;&#10;        _uiState.value = UiState.Error(throwable.message ?: &quot;未知错误&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun loadData() {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch(exceptionHandler) {&#10;            _uiState.value = UiState.Loading&#10;            val data = repository.getData()&#10;            _uiState.value = UiState.Success(data)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun safeApiCall() {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch {&#10;            val result = runCatching { repository.getData() }&#10;            result.fold(&#10;                onSuccess = { _uiState.value = UiState.Success(it) },&#10;                onFailure = { e -&gt;&#10;                    if (e is CancellationException) throw e&#10;                    _uiState.value = UiState.Error(e.message ?: &quot;请求失败&quot;)&#10;                }&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;sealed interface UiState {&#10;    data object Loading : UiState&#10;    data class Success(val data: List&lt;Item&gt;) : UiState&#10;    data class Error(val message: String) : UiState&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@HiltViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class SafeViewModel @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository: DataRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow&#x3C;UiState>(UiState.Loading)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val uiState = _uiState.asStateFlow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val exceptionHandler = CoroutineExceptionHandler { _, throwable -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _uiState.value = UiState.Error(throwable.message ?: \"未知错误\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun loadData() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch(exceptionHandler) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _uiState.value = UiState.Loading</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val data = repository.getData()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _uiState.value = UiState.Success(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun safeApiCall() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val result = runCatching { repository.getData() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            result.fold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onSuccess = { _uiState.value = UiState.Success(it) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onFailure = { e -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    if (e is CancellationException) throw e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    _uiState.value = UiState.Error(e.message ?: \"请求失败\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed interface UiState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data object Loading : UiState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Success(val data: List&#x3C;Item>) : UiState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Error(val message: String) : UiState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>runCatching</code> 时必须重新抛出 <code>CancellationException</code>，否则会破坏协程的取消机制。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>viewModelScope</code> 在 ViewModel 清除时自动取消协程，是最常用的作用域</li>\n<li><code>lifecycleScope</code> + <code>repeatOnLifecycle</code> 确保 Flow 收集随生命周期启停</li>\n<li>通过依赖注入提供 Dispatcher，IO 操作用 <code>Dispatchers.IO</code>，计算用 <code>Dispatchers.Default</code></li>\n<li>结构化并发通过 <code>coroutineScope</code> 和 <code>async</code> 实现并行请求</li>\n<li>异常处理中必须正确处理 <code>CancellationException</code>，不能静默吞掉</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Android 协程","id":"android-协程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"viewModelScope","id":"viewmodelscope"},{"level":2,"text":"lifecycleScope","id":"lifecyclescope"},{"level":2,"text":"调度器选择","id":"调度器选择"},{"level":2,"text":"取消与结构化并发","id":"取消与结构化并发"},{"level":2,"text":"异常处理","id":"异常处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Retrofit 与 OkHttp","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/networking-and-data/retrofit-and-okhttp"},"next":{"title":"Flow 与 LiveData","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/networking-and-data/flow-and-livedata"}}